From: zeroday0619 <escha@zeroday0619.dev>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 08:12:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] ui: align Anubis controls with shared settings forms

Anubis settings use different switches, cards and native selects from
the other settings sections, making related controls look inconsistent.

Share the existing settings form cards and rows. Use the common checkbox,
select, input and alert components for Anubis settings while retaining
the shared switch used by proxy host lists.
